e attitudes toward EBPs. \n\nFrom the previous review of the literature, we can conclude that there is an unmet need to explore teachers' use of EBPs in teaching Arabic language for students with learning disabilities. Research related to exploring teachers' use of EBPs in language teaching for students with learning disabilities is limited either in the international or regional contexts.",
