        "title": "Leveraging the potential of ChatGPT as an automated writing evaluation (AWE) tool: Students' feedback literacy development and AWE tools integration framework",
        "authors": [
          "I. Gozali",
          "Alberik Ryan Tendy Wijaya",
          "Anita Lie",
          "B. Cahyono",
