els can grade as accurately as human raters, particularly in essay assessment. LLMs, like GPT variants, have demonstrated high accuracy in evaluating K-12 students' responses to open-ended short-answer questions across various domains (e.g., science and history), closely aligning with expert human raters [11] [12], in their study on AI exam graders (GPT-3.5,",
