ich changes to incorporate. Furthermore, ongoing research and development are needed to improve ai tools to better support the preservation of authenticity in eFl writing. Future advancements in ai could include more sophisticated algorithms that consider the cultural and individual contexts of the writer, producing feedback and suggestions that enhance rather than dilute the writer's unique voice.",
