        "text": "The following literature review critically examines Automated Essay Scoring (AES) tools like PEG, e-rater, and Intelli-Metric™, tracing their evolution and methodologies from early statistical approaches to advanced natural language processing models. These tools have significantly influenced educational assessment by automating essay evaluation based on predefined criteria. The reviewed studies will evaluate the effectiveness and reliability of these tools in comparison to human graders and address criticisms of their capability to assess creativity and contextual complexities in writing. This review aims to contextualize findings within the dynamic field of AES, setting the tone for an exploration of ChatGPT's potential contributions. As an advanced AI language model capable of contextual understanding and generating coherent text, ChatGPT represents a promising advancement in addressing the limitations of current AES tools. Evaluating its role in essay assessment will provide insights into the future of AI-driven educational technology and assessment practices.",
