iting evaluation,\" the first to emphasize the summative aspect of the practice, and the second to emphasize its broader applications. While I am sensitive to the fine-grained distinctions inherent in these varied wordings, I have chosen to use \"automated writing evaluation,\" following the terminology used in the most recent industry-produced volume on automated essay techniques, the Handbook of Automated Essay Evaluation . While names are not neutral signifiers, adopting the sanctioned",
