oving vocabulary and sentence structure, chatgPt helps students overcome common obstacles, streamlining the writing process and boosting confidence (liu et al., 2023; malik et al., 2023). it acts as a personalized tutor, providing real-time feedback and adjustments tailored to individual needs, resulting in a more coherent and well-crafted piece of writing. this example underscores the importance of integrating ai tools like chatgPt into educational practices to support and enhance student learning.",
