egy application. Therefore, Writers frequently seek out tools and resources to help them improve their writing, ensuring it is clear, concise, and errorfree. One of the most used grammar-checking tools in education is Grammarly, which can improve users' writing abilities if used regularly (Arisandi & Sudarajat, 2023). \n\nBesides grammar error-free, students must also paraphrase their writing to lessen plagiarism when they cite someone else's work.",
