        "text": "The results revealed significant improvements in the experimental group's writing skills, engagement, and feedback literacy, highlighting the positive impact of AI integration. Similarly, Huang and Teng (2025) investigated the use of ChatGPT among Japanese EFL students in higher education. Their findings demonstrated that carefully crafted prompts enhanced both affective and behavioral engagement. However, cognitive engagement showed only a modest improvement and was not statistically significant when compared to students who did not use ChatGPT. Together, these studies underscore the potential of generative AI tools like ChatGPT to foster student engagement and improve learning outcomes in diverse educational settings. Nonetheless, further research is needed to assess its effectiveness across varied contexts and to address existing challenges and limitations.",
